      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Paraganglioma of the filum terminale is rare. The authors report a case of paraganglioma of the filum terminale presenting with paraparesis on a background of spastic quadriparesis. The clinical presentation, radiological findings and current literature are presented."},
